als who are  wealthy and it's it's all part of this  dynamic that you described in the book  which is excellent winners take all the  elite charade of changing the world  we've been speaking with the book's  author Anand Giridhar das author  columnist on air political analyst  a pleasure speaking to you today thank  you so much for having me

